    "title": "Top outfielder in Oregon's Class of 2027 announces commitment to OSU - NewsBreak",
    "text": "By Emma Watkins No media credit provided. ,\n4 hours ago\nPORTLAND, Ore. (KOIN) — Beaverton High School’s Chase Austin has officially announced his commitment to Oregon State baseball via social media on Tuesday.\nThe future Beaver is currently the top-ranked outfielder in Oregon’s class of 2027, according to Baseball Northwest. Austin released his decision via X.\nAustin released his decision via X.\nCopyright 2025 Nexstar Media, Inc. All rights reserved. This material may not be published, broadcast, rewritten, or redistributed. For the latest news, weather, sports, and streaming video, head to KOIN.com.",
